              "type": "text",
              "text": "The annotations clarify specific conditions and limitations of idempotency keys that might be missed in the prose. They highlight the time-bound nature of the protection (24 hours) and the critical distinction that keys do not make different requests safe, even if the key is reused. This emphasizes that idempotency is not a universal solution for all duplicate operation scenarios.",
